'''Mashiro''' (Japanese: '''マシロ''' ''Mashiro'') is the ending theme of ''[[A Pocketful of Adventures]]''. The song was performed by {{wp|Sumika (band)|sumika}}.

The song was performed at the [https://www.tv-tokyo.co.jp/musicfestival2023/ Teleto 60 Sai! Music Festival 2023] on November 15, 2023. The full version was released as a digital single on December 22, 2023.<ref>[https://www.sumika-official.com/news/9b4d3da7-176c-4885-95f3-e4d21d56557a 新曲『マシロ』12月22日より配信スタート！ | sumika オフィシャルホームページ]</ref>

==Ending video==
===Synopsis===
The ending video opens with a sign displaying the beach rules in the town of Mashiro. The camera zooms out to reveal [[Madoka Akagi]] walking while playing on her [[Game Boy Pocket]]. Gameplay from {{game|Red and Green|s|Pokémon Red}} is shown in the top-right as she continues walking along the seashore.

